{
  "_comment": "fetch(urls, options): the JSON body sent to POST /v1/fetch (\"body\" cases) and what a reply becomes (\"responses\" cases). Options are flat and named as on the wire (max_chars, schema, links, images, max_age_hours); each SDK maps them to its own spelling. Body rules: urls are sent in order (a lone string is one URL), 1 to 10 of them, each passing the fetch_url rules, else the invalid-request error and nothing is sent. max_chars, schema, links and images go in a content object, max_age_hours in a retrieval object; an unset option is not sent, and an object with nothing set is left out. Limits: max_chars an integer of at least 1; links an integer from 1 to 1000; images an integer from 0 to 25; max_age_hours a finite number from 0 to 720, fractions allowed (0 is a live read); schema an object whose \"type\" is \"object\", sent as given. Anything else is the invalid-request error. {\"$float\": \"NaN\"} stands for a number JSON cannot hold. `sent` is the whole body, compared as JSON. Response rules: results is a list (anything else is []); an entry that is not an object is skipped. An entry whose error is an object is a failed URL: its error is the SDK's API error built from that object as if it were an error body with the status error.status (an integer from 400 to 599, else 500) and no headers, so its class, type, code, detail, fix, retryable and request_id follow the errors rules. Any other entry is a page, read by the page rules: title and content the string sent or \"\"; description, author, image and favicon a string with more than whitespace or null; published_at such a string as sent, or Unix seconds as ISO 8601 UTC (see responses); truncated a boolean and total_chars an integer from 0 to 2^53 - 1, else null; links [{url, text}] and images [{url, alt}] when a list (entries that are not objects skipped; url the string sent or \"\", text and alt a string with more than whitespace or null), else null; structured the object sent, else null; answer_error {code, message} (strings, \"\" otherwise) when an object, else null; stale a boolean or null; usage, when an object, {sku: string or \"\", amount: integer from 0 to 2^53 - 1 or 0, credits: finite number or 0, paid: true only when true, credits_remaining: finite number or null}, else null. A result's url is the page's url, or the failed entry's url when a string with more than whitespace; either falls back to the URL asked for at the entry's position. request_id is the body's when such a string, else the trimmed X-Request-Id header, else null. A body that is not a JSON object, or a non-2xx reply, is the call's error (expect.error is its kind). In expect, page fields left out are \"\" (title, content) or null, error fields left out are null, and a result has exactly one of page and error. `skip` names an SDK whose types cannot express the case, with why.",
  "body": [
    {"name": "one url, no options", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"]}},
    {"name": "several urls in order", "urls": ["https://e.com/a", "https://e.com/b"], "options": {}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://e.com/a", "https://e.com/b"]}},
    {"name": "a lone url string is one url", "urls": "https://example.com/", "options": {}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"]}, "skip": {"go": "Fetch takes a []string", "rust": "fetch takes a slice of URLs"}},
    {"name": "ten urls is the most", "urls": ["https://e.com/0", "https://e.com/1", "https://e.com/2", "https://e.com/3", "https://e.com/4", "https://e.com/5", "https://e.com/6", "https://e.com/7", "https://e.com/8", "https://e.com/9"], "options": {}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://e.com/0", "https://e.com/1", "https://e.com/2", "https://e.com/3", "https://e.com/4", "https://e.com/5", "https://e.com/6", "https://e.com/7", "https://e.com/8", "https://e.com/9"]}},
    {"name": "max_chars", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 20000}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"max_chars": 20000}}},
    {"name": "max_chars 1 is the least", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 1}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"max_chars": 1}}},
    {"name": "a schema", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"price": {"type": "number"}}, "required": ["price"]}}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"price": {"type": "number"}}, "required": ["price"]}}}},
    {"name": "links and images", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"links": 50, "images": 5}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"links": 50, "images": 5}}},
    {"name": "images 0 is sent", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"images": 0}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"images": 0}}},
    {"name": "the most links and images", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"links": 1000, "images": 25}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"links": 1000, "images": 25}}},
    {"name": "a stored copy no older than a day", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age_hours": 24}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "retrieval": {"max_age_hours": 24}}},
    {"name": "fractional hours", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age_hours": 0.25}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "retrieval": {"max_age_hours": 0.25}}},
    {"name": "max_age_hours 0 is sent: a live read", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age_hours": 0}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "retrieval": {"max_age_hours": 0}}},
    {"name": "max_age_hours 720 is the most", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age_hours": 720}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "retrieval": {"max_age_hours": 720}}},
    {"name": "every option", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 1000, "schema": {"type": "object"}, "links": 3, "images": 2, "max_age_hours": 1.5}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"max_chars": 1000, "schema": {"type": "object"}, "links": 3, "images": 2}, "retrieval": {"max_age_hours": 1.5}}},
    {"name": "no urls", "urls": [], "options": {}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "eleven urls", "urls": ["https://e.com/0", "https://e.com/1", "https://e.com/2", "https://e.com/3", "https://e.com/4", "https://e.com/5", "https://e.com/6", "https://e.com/7", "https://e.com/8", "https://e.com/9", "https://e.com/10"], "options": {}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "one private url refuses the call", "urls": ["https://example.com/", "http://127.0.0.1/"], "options": {}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "a url that is not a string", "urls": [5], "options": {}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"go": "the option is typed", "rust": "the option is typed"}},
    {"name": "an empty url", "urls": [""], "options": {}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "max_chars 0", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 0}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"go": "FetchOptions.MaxChars is an int whose zero means unset"}},
    {"name": "a negative max_chars", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": -1}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"rust": "the option is unsigned"}},
    {"name": "a fractional max_chars", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 1.5}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"go": "the option is typed", "rust": "the option is typed"}},
    {"name": "a boolean max_chars", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": true}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"go": "the option is typed", "rust": "the option is typed"}},
    {"name": "links 0", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"links": 0}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"go": "FetchOptions.Links is an int whose zero means unset"}},
    {"name": "links over 1000", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"links": 1001}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "negative images", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"images": -1}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"rust": "the option is unsigned"}},
    {"name": "images over 25", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"images": 26}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "negative max_age_hours", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age_hours": -1}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "max_age_hours over 720", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age_hours": 720.5}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "a max_age_hours that is not a number", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age_hours": {"$float": "NaN"}}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "a schema without a type", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"schema": {"properties": {}}}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "a schema whose root is not an object", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"schema": {"type": "array"}}, "invalid": true},
    {"name": "a schema that is not an object", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"schema": "object"}, "invalid": true, "skip": {"go": "FetchOptions.Schema is a map"}}
  ],
  "responses": [
    {"name": "a page and a failed url", "urls": ["https://e.com/a", "https://e.com/b"], "headers": {"X-Request-Id": "req_h"}, "json": {"results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a/", "title": "A", "content": "hello", "truncated": false, "total_chars": 5, "description": "", "author": "Ann", "published_at": 1714564800, "image": "https://e.com/i.png", "favicon": "https://e.com/f.ico", "images": [{"url": "https://e.com/i.png", "alt": "I"}], "links": [{"url": "https://e.com/x", "text": "X"}, {"url": "https://e.com/y", "text": null}], "structured": {"price": 9.5}, "stale": true, "usage": {"sku": "fetch", "amount": 1, "credits": 1, "paid": true, "credits_remaining": 99.5}}, {"url": "https://e.com/b", "error": {"status": 404, "error": "Page not found", "type": "target_error", "code": "page_not_found", "message": "The page does not exist.", "fix": "Check the URL.", "docs_url": "https://docs.keenable.ai/errors#page_not_found", "request_id": "req_b", "retryable": false}}]}, "expect": {"request_id": "req_h", "results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a/", "page": {"url": "https://e.com/a/", "title": "A", "content": "hello", "truncated": false, "total_chars": 5, "author": "Ann", "published_at": "2024-05-01T12:00:00Z", "image": "https://e.com/i.png", "favicon": "https://e.com/f.ico", "images": [{"url": "https://e.com/i.png", "alt": "I"}], "links": [{"url": "https://e.com/x", "text": "X"}, {"url": "https://e.com/y", "text": null}], "structured": {"price": 9.5}, "stale": true, "usage": {"sku": "fetch", "amount": 1, "credits": 1, "paid": true, "credits_remaining": 99.5}}}, {"url": "https://e.com/b", "error": {"kind": "api", "status": 404, "type": "target_error", "code": "page_not_found", "detail": "The page does not exist.", "fix": "Check the URL.", "retryable": false, "request_id": "req_b"}}]}},
